## Strings used by attachment actions: saving, opening, detaching and deleting.

attachment-save-dialog-title = Sàbhail an ceanglachan
attachment-save-all-dialog-title = Sàbhail a h-uile ceanglachan
attachment-detach-dialog-title = Dealaich an ceanglachan
attachment-detach-all-dialog-title = Dealaich a h-uile ceanglachan
attachment-save-failed = Cha ghabh an ceanglachan a shàbhaladh. Cuir sùil air ainm an fhaidhle 's feuch ris a-rithist an ceann tamaill.
# Variables:
#   $filename (String) - Name of the file that already exists.
attachment-file-exists = Tha { $filename } ann mu thràth. A bheil thu airson a chur 'na àite?
# Variables:
#   $attachments (String) - Newline separated list of attachment names.
attachment-delete-confirm =
    Thèid na ceanglachain a leanas a sguabadh às on teachdaireachd seo:
    { $attachments }
    Chan urrainn dhut seo a neo-dhèanamh. A bheil thu airson leantainn air adhart?
# Variables:
#   $attachments (String) - Newline separated list of attachment names.
attachment-detach-confirm =
    Chaidh na ceanglachain a leanas a shàbhaladh 's thèid an sguabadh às gu buan on teachdaireachd seo a-nis:
    { $attachments }
    Chan urrainn dhut seo a neo-dhèanamh. A bheil thu airson leantainn air adhart?
attachment-empty =
    Tha coltas gu bheil an ceanglachan a leanas falamh.
    Bidh cachaileithean-teine aig companaidhean no prògraman
    ana-bhìorais a' dubhadh às ceanglachain gu tric.
attachment-external-not-found = Cha deach am faidhle dealaichte no ceanglachan ceangail a lorg no chan eil e ri fhaighinn aig an ionad seo tuilleadh.
